Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying everything\NI've done was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I did the Spirit of Origin's bidding,\Nmurdered countless people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and even took the life of a close friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, to rid the world of that Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave behind a mountain of corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.29,0:00:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a devil. An enemy of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I kill, kill, and kill some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A "nightmare" of endless death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If there really is an afterlife,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bound for the lowest level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I can slay the\NSpirit of Origin, Mio Takamiya,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,by my own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Takamiya...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to redo everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.17,0:01:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all that's happened back to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But for that, I need the power you hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,With your power,\NI know I can change history!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,History...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.93,0:01:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go into the past and erase\Nthe Spirit of Origin,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never become a Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.73,0:01:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawa's death... and everyone else's deaths\Nwill simply not happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my devouring of you\Nshould cease to take place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me borrow\Nyour power to make it so!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, there's nothing\NI can offer as a fair trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it doesn't change\Nthe fact I'm asking for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the least I can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,...is to give you my everything,\Nsave for my Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you two having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let us stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be sad to die\Nwithout "knowing" a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,For being a bunch of phony Spirits,\Nyou sure have some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're calling us phony?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're\Ninsulting Father to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel, Zayin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi? Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet another failure?\NThat's quite curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems odd to me knowing Beelzebub\Nset her up for success.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If inability isn't the reason for failure,\NI'd love to hear what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Ellen. You're not holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then. What do you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? She's asking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:06:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You've failed more than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.63,0:06:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a mad grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Being old must suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,People get in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nightmare," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a nuisance! What's her problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.27,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for her, we could've killed\NShido Itsuka dozens of times!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... The Worst Spirit\Nprotecting a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What strange times we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems too implausible,\Neven for Nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's defied every single plan of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she knows what we plan to do,\Neven before we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Were our plans leaked?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not our plans,\Nbut our attacks themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:07:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi, are you okay? Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Kurumi's... clone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. The me before you is sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let her rest for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's completely exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She was tired to begin with,\Nnot to mention all the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,To get straight to the point, Shido,\Nyou have already died.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To be precise, you should be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I suppose I should say\Nit's possible you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.49,0:07:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kurumi. I came as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:08:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning, I noticed something:\NYou've changed a bit, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you've matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, I suppose it's expected with all\Nthe carnage you've lived through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't make fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's this condition of yours\Nfor sealing your Spirit power?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,--Shido!\N--Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone, I think we're\Nthe ones interfering.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with these guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Confusion. Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel, Daletto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka and the others fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They've gone inverse, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Inverse...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no surprise, with Shido\Nkilled before their very eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,--Me.\N--Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:10:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. We barely made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't leave him behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Daletto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido! Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Daletto's bullet reverses time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but it can't bring back\Na life that is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I... failed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed Shido, and failed at erasing\Nthe Spirit of Origin, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.79,0:12:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Z-Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?\NMy sixth bullet, Vav, is restored?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Vav sends a mind into the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was broken during\Nthe fight with Kotori...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since, we haven't\Nbeen able to use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,After my fight with Kotori,\Nbut before I had left,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you a kiss as thanks for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When that happened, I believe\Nmy sixth bullet, Vav, was sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Though not fully,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,it was at that point\Nthat I opened my heart to you, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was unable to use Vav\Nnot because Zaphkiel was broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but because part of my Spirit power\Nhad been sealed by that kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now, by kissing him again,\Nhas that power returned to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Me's... Please die for Shido's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives are fleeting anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:14:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Use us to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means saving Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...I'll gladly visit the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You, being me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...should know we wouldn't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I ask that you come with me\Non an endless journey of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel, Vav.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:41.52,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Tengu City"\N"February 8    Thursday"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, from February 8th till today,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been protecting you, Shido,\Nwithout your knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:15:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The first attack was thwarted\Nthanks to help from Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,--Two hundred and four.\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how many times since February 8th\Nyou've fallen into DEM's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,On the morning of February 10,\Nthey even attacked you at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And many more times, over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.07,0:15:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Each time, I've kissed you to regain Vav
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and send my mind into the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It has strained my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeating the same days so many times\Nhas pushed my psyche to the limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, please allow me to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you just\Ndevour me at the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.31,0:16:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's way easier for you\Nthan repeating everything 204 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't ask something so thoughtless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My feelings... for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you enjoyed your little\Nchat while I was busy sleeping, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.65,0:16:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This younger "me" is being foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:17:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I only helped you so I don't lose all\Nthe Spirit power you've sealed thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave it at that for today.\NUntil next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You said things you shouldn't have, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.37,0:17:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may, I fail to see\Nwhat the problem is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My resolve--my hardship has been\Nanything but ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:18:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's enough to fall asleep in front\Nof Shido, albeit for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That being the case,\Nwho can fault me for telling him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, given all the times\NI've saved Shido,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.69,0:18:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,surely he holds feelings\Nof gratitude towards me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What bad could come of it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He might get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It might seem like he's touched\Nmy heart or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, I suppose so!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like you're mocking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we got through today,\Nwe don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:19:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,DEM Industries will attack again shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have so much energy\Nand strength. At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Troubled, are we, Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Phantom...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.67,0:19:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a very warm welcome.\NI only came to give some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome {\i1}you{\i}? You best think twice\Nbefore making jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So cold. Haven't I helped you by\Nproviding information all those times?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't I the one who told you\Nabout Shido Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see. You know, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.41,0:19:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad. I really did\Ncome to give you advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel, Zayin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoops, I let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is your true form, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I didn't expect to be stripped of\Nmy temporary form so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.37,0:20:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Kurumi for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Murasame...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, it's all falling into place!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Me's!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hell deep enough\Nfor the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.74,0:21:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--Shido!\N--Relief, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, you worried us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's okay, I'm all right. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, can we locate Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Reine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No. She's missing at the moment.\NI'll keep searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.27,0:21:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.31,0:21:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,About all that's happened...\Nand everything Kurumi's done for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I need everyone's help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, it's my turn to save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:52.79,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 12:\N'Cycle of Salvation.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits: Special designation disaster\Nbeings that exist in a critical space.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.22,0:23:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The origin of Spirits... The mystery of\NShido Itsuka... All shall become clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.35,0:23:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Date A Live 5{\i}, planned for production!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.69,0:23:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,
